{"seq":3,"slug":"large-world-coordinates","title":"大世界坐标精度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-streaming-open-world/foundations/large-world-coordinates","wordCount":1866,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"大世界坐标精度\">大世界坐标精度</h1><p>把世界切成 cell 解决了内存问题，却暴露了另一个潜伏的麻烦：当玩家走到离世界原点几十公里之外，他脚下的物体会开始肉眼可见地<strong>抖动</strong>——角色微微震颤、远处建筑边缘闪烁、物理模拟变得不稳定。这不是 bug，是 32 位浮点数在大数值区精度耗尽的必然后果。世界越大，这个问题越致命，它直接决定了「你的世界到底能做多大」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>根源是浮点数的相对精度：32 位单精度浮点（float）有 23 位尾数，能表示的有效数字大约 7 位十进制。这意味着浮点的绝对精度随数值大小<strong>线性恶化</strong>——数值越大，相邻两个可表示数之间的间隔越大。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[float 23 位尾数&lt;br/&gt;约 7 位有效数字] --&gt; B[相对精度恒定&lt;br/&gt;绝对精度随数值恶化]&#10;    B --&gt; C[近原点&lt;br/&gt;毫米级精度]&#10;    B --&gt; D[远离原点 10km+&lt;br/&gt;精度退化到米级]&#10;    D --&gt; E[物体抖动&lt;br/&gt;物理不稳]&#10;    E --&gt; F[解法一: 大世界坐标 LWC&lt;br/&gt;核心类型升 double]&#10;    E --&gt; G[解法二: 原点重定位&lt;br/&gt;周期性把世界拉回原点]\">flowchart TD\n    A[float 23 位尾数&lt;br/&gt;约 7 位有效数字] --&gt; B[相对精度恒定&lt;br/&gt;绝对精度随数值恶化]\n    B --&gt; C[近原点&lt;br/&gt;毫米级精度]\n    B --&gt; D[远离原点 10km+&lt;br/&gt;精度退化到米级]\n    D --&gt; E[物体抖动&lt;br/&gt;物理不稳]\n    E --&gt; F[解法一: 大世界坐标 LWC&lt;br/&gt;核心类型升 double]\n    E --&gt; G[解法二: 原点重定位&lt;br/&gt;周期性把世界拉回原点]</pre><p>对一个量级为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 的坐标，相邻可表示浮点数的间隔（机器精度尺度）约为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≈</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>23</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon(x) \\approx x \\cdot 2^{-23}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">23</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>代入具体数值就能看出灾难何时发生。下面把「离原点多远」翻译成「最小可分辨间隔」：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>离原点距离</th>\n<th>float 间隔 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th>后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1 m</td>\n<td>约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.2</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.2 \\times 10^{-7}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">7</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> m</td>\n<td>远超需求，无感</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1 km（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> m）</td>\n<td>约 0.12 mm</td>\n<td>仍然够用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>16 km（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.6</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.6\\times10^4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.6</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> m）</td>\n<td>约 2 mm</td>\n<td>UE4 旧世界边界，临界</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>100 km（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>5</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> m）</td>\n<td>约 12 mm</td>\n<td>角色明显抖动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1000 km</td>\n<td>约 12 cm</td>\n<td>物理与渲染崩坏</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>UE4 时代世界被 float 限制在约 21km 的边界内，再大就要靠原点重定位绕过。这张表也解释了为什么「近原点一切正常、走远了才出问题」——精度问题是<strong>位置相关</strong>的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"抖动从哪来-不是位置错-是变换链放大误差\">抖动从哪来：不是位置错，是变换链放大误差</h2><p>很多人以为抖动是「物体位置存错了」，其实更微妙：单个坐标存成 float 误差很小，真正放大误差的是<strong>变换链</strong>。渲染时，物体的世界坐标要经过「世界 → 相机 → 裁剪」一连串矩阵乘法。当相机在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>100000</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(100000, 0, 0)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">100000</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>、物体也在附近，两个大数相减得到一个小的相对偏移——这正是浮点最不擅长的「大数相减」（catastrophic cancellation，灾难性抵消），高位有效数字在相减时被抵消，结果只剩下被噪声污染的低位。</p>\n<p>于是同一帧里相机和物体都没动，可它们各自的 float 误差不同，相减后的相对位置每帧都在最低位跳变，画面上就是抖动。物理积分同理：速度乘以时间步长累加到一个巨大的位置上，小增量被大数值「吃掉」，物体要么不动要么乱跳。这说明问题的本质是「在远离原点处做大数的相对运算」，两条解法都围绕这一点展开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"解法一-大世界坐标-lwc-把核心类型升-double\">解法一：大世界坐标（LWC）——把核心类型升 double</h2><p>最直接的解法是提高精度本身。Unreal Engine 5 的 <strong>Large World Coordinates（LWC，大世界坐标）</strong> 把引擎核心数据类型（向量、变换、矩阵等）从 32 位 float 升级为 64 位 double。double 有 52 位尾数、约 15~16 位十进制有效数字，把上面的间隔公式换成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≈</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>52</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon(x) \\approx x \\cdot 2^{-52}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">52</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，在 100km 处间隔降到约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>11</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\times10^{-11}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">11</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> m——精度过剩到可以忽略。</p>\n<p>LWC 把 UE 的最大世界尺寸从 UE4 时代的约 21km 一举拉到约 8800 万公里（行星际尺度），并显著提升远离原点处 Actor 的放置与朝向精度。代价是 double 占内存翻倍、CPU 运算更慢，以及一个长期的工程难题：<strong>GPU 仍主要以 float 工作</strong>。把整条相机相对的渲染坐标都升 double 在 GPU 上代价高昂，Epic 的 LWC 渲染因此采用「CPU 端 double、传给 GPU 前转成相机相对的 float」的混合策略——大数相减在 double 域里先做完，传到 GPU 的已是小的相对量，从根上避开了灾难性抵消。LWC 的 GPU 全双精度仍在 Epic 的公开路线图上持续重构。</p>\n<h2 id=\"解法二-原点重定位-周期性把世界拉回原点\">解法二：原点重定位——周期性把世界拉回原点</h2><p>在不能整体升 double 的引擎里（或为节省成本），经典解法是<strong>原点重定位（origin rebasing / world origin shifting）</strong>：保持 float，但周期性地把整个世界的坐标原点平移到玩家附近，让玩家始终待在「近原点的高精度区」。</p>\n<p>具体做法是设一个阈值距离 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_{th}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，当玩家离当前原点超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_{th}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，就把世界原点平移到玩家当前位置，所有 Actor 坐标同步减去这个平移量：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mi>i</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msubsup><mo>=</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∀</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec{p}_i&#x27; = \\vec{p}_i - \\vec{p}_{player}, \\quad \\forall i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0489em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1522em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9084em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1522em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0001em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1522em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">pl</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∀</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>平移后玩家回到接近 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(0,0,0)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，所有物体重新落入高精度区，抖动消失。它的精妙在于「精度问题是位置相关的，那就让玩家永远不离开高精度位置」。代价是：每次重定位要遍历并改写所有 Actor 坐标（有开销，需挑帧做）、所有缓存的绝对坐标（导航数据、物理世界、网络同步的位置）都要同步更新——尤其网络环境下多客户端的原点必须协调一致，否则位置对不上。这也是为什么联机大世界更倾向 LWC 而非重定位，详见 <a href=\"../practice/streaming-networking\">流送与联机</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"两条解法怎么选\">两条解法怎么选</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>LWC（升 double）</th>\n<th>原点重定位（保 float）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>精度上限</td>\n<td>行星际（约 8800 万 km）</td>\n<td>取决于阈值，理论无限大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内存/CPU 开销</td>\n<td>double 翻倍，常驻成本</td>\n<td>平移时一次性遍历，平时无开销</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实现复杂度</td>\n<td>引擎级支持，用户侧基本透明</td>\n<td>需手工管理缓存坐标失效</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GPU 友好度</td>\n<td>需混合策略，渲染要改造</td>\n<td>天然 float，GPU 无改动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>联机协调</td>\n<td>各端绝对坐标一致，简单</td>\n<td>各端原点须协调，复杂</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用</td>\n<td>UE5 等原生支持的现代引擎</td>\n<td>自研引擎、移动端、内存敏感场景</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>实践中二者并不互斥：UE5 默认走 LWC，但极远尺度（太空、行星）项目仍可能叠加分层坐标或局部重定位。选型的核心问题是「世界多大、是否联机、引擎是否原生支持 double」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>大世界精度问题的根源是 float 约 7 位有效数字，绝对间隔随距离线性恶化（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≈</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>23</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon(x)\\approx x\\cdot 2^{-23}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">23</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）：100km 处退化到厘米级，物体抖动、物理崩坏。</li>\n<li>抖动的直接成因是远离原点处的大数相减（灾难性抵消）放大了渲染变换链与物理积分中的低位误差。</li>\n<li>解法一 LWC：核心类型升 double，世界上限拉到约 8800 万 km；代价是内存翻倍与 GPU 需混合（CPU double + 相机相对 float）策略。</li>\n<li>解法二原点重定位：保 float，周期性把原点平移到玩家附近，让玩家永远在高精度区；代价是遍历改写与缓存坐标失效，联机协调尤其麻烦。</li>\n<li>选型看世界尺度、是否联机、引擎是否原生支持 double；现代引擎默认 LWC，自研/移动端常用重定位。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>坐标精度是流送之外的另一块基础地基：<a href=\"why-streaming\">为何世界流送</a></li>\n<li>重定位与联机的协调难题：<a href=\"../practice/streaming-networking\">流送与联机</a></li>\n<li>跨库——浮点与缓存数据布局的底层视角：<a href=\"../../game-performance-optimization/cpu/cache-data-oriented\">性能优化 · 缓存与数据导向</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"大世界坐标精度","id":"大世界坐标精度"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"抖动从哪来：不是位置错，是变换链放大误差","id":"抖动从哪来-不是位置错-是变换链放大误差"},{"level":2,"text":"解法一：大世界坐标（LWC）——把核心类型升 double","id":"解法一-大世界坐标-lwc-把核心类型升-double"},{"level":2,"text":"解法二：原点重定位——周期性把世界拉回原点","id":"解法二-原点重定位-周期性把世界拉回原点"},{"level":2,"text":"两条解法怎么选","id":"两条解法怎么选"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"世界分区","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-streaming-open-world/foundations/world-partitioning"},"next":{"title":"按距离流送","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-streaming-open-world/streaming/distance-based-streaming"}}